{"name": "Martial Soul Arena", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Martial Soul Arena is a 3D top-down Action Roguelite. You can build and nurture your heroes and select your favorite character, freely combine abilities to forge your own combat build. Fight your way through endless surging swarms of enemies. Random upgrade rewards and branching path choices let you craft unique skills. You can pull off spectacular combo sequences without complicated inputs,  every battle delivers tense, thrilling and satisfying gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game offers partial customization for character appearances, features heroes with diverse unique mechanics, and boasts countless combinations of skills and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"528\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/6fda32191e8e1bad7aa597e4023cf639.poster.avif?t=1786937578\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/6fda32191e8e1bad7aa597e4023cf639.webm?t=1786937578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/6fda32191e8e1bad7aa597e4023cf639.mp4?t=1786937578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying combos, multi-stage pursuit strikes, flame explosions, area shockwaves, flying  slashes and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"528\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/dc6296cd13baf55810cb8164ae7843e8.poster.avif?t=1786937578\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/dc6296cd13baf55810cb8164ae7843e8.webm?t=1786937578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/dc6296cd13baf55810cb8164ae7843e8.mp4?t=1786937578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spectacular, powerful and cool combat actions.Dazzling effects, defeat entire hordes of incoming enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"528\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/eed8e5fd55337c30238a1248e01e1637.poster.avif?t=1786937578\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/eed8e5fd55337c30238a1248e01e1637.webm?t=1786937578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/eed8e5fd55337c30238a1248e01e1637.mp4?t=1786937578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up in battle, upgrade your skills, gain more powerful abilities, and take on stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"566\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/5c6a334f3f85d23b94e2f41038a94da8.poster.avif?t=1786937578\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/5c6a334f3f85d23b94e2f41038a94da8.webm?t=1786937578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/5c6a334f3f85d23b94e2f41038a94da8.mp4?t=1786937578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of equipment grants you different abilities in battle and enhances your attributes. You can choose different styles, craft your own combat build, and enjoy a satisfying battle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras_big/2b98632b24a0606777ee714999d85966.avif?t=1786937578\" height=\"876\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/2b98632b24a0606777ee714999d85966.avif?t=1786937578\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple playable characters, each with distinct stats and unique mechanics. Select your favorite warrior, and let them battle for you throughout the virtual world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras_big/4c30863c13c819df292cf235a08776aa.avif?t=1786937578\" height=\"876\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/extras/4c30863c13c819df292cf235a08776aa.avif?t=1786937578\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022 Flexibly combine abilities to create your own combat style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022 Cool actions, dazzling effects, and satisfying combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Multiple playable heroes with unique mechanics and distinct combat feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022 Procedurally generated upgrade paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuous content updates will be rolled out in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "An action roguelite that blends personalized hero customization with high-speed hack-and-slash. Create your own unique hero and fight your way through endless hordes of monsters! Every run brings new upgrades, new gear, new possibilities \u2014 what kind of combat experience will you create?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4836420/f2e25149d4565c2b5ee410d98ced65120c0352b1/header.jpg?t=1786937578", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Action", "Hack and Slash", "Action RPG", "RPG", "Beat 'em up"], "developers": "Aoyou Studio", "publishers": "Aoyou Studio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4836420", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "14 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/3gzyMde6nYw", "first_seen": 1786658400.0, "review_rank": 107}